+# m02 to m07: lines to voice after the stage-direction pass
+
+Stage directions were taken out of voiced lines in m02 to m07 (`STAGE_DIRECTIONS_M02_M07.md`, which has the before text of every line). Each line below has new text, a new `#delivery:` note, or both, so each needs a new clip. A delivery note is part of the cache key: voice the line with its note, which the batch reads from the ink. No clip was generated or deleted. Old clips are orphaned only in m02 and m03; take them from `tts:wasted` after voicing, not from this list. Ghost's video-call lines carry no note (phone calls do not send one).
